WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.998
Katie and Joy hurried home from school and parked their bikes by the front porch.

2
00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:10.208
"Grandpa!" they called.

3
00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:14.780
"I'm here in the backyard," they heard him shout.

4
00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:20.514
"Come on, Katie," said Joy, and they ran toward the backyard.

5
00:00:20.515 --> 00:00:23.812
Grandpa was building a coop with a fence around it.

6
00:00:23.813 --> 00:00:26.980
A pile of lumber lay on the ground.

7
00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:31.836
Joy opened the gate to the coop, and all six chickens ran out.

8
00:00:31.837 --> 00:00:35.703
"Hi, chickens!" she said.

9
00:00:35.704 --> 00:00:38.674
"Guess what, Grandpa!" said Katie.

10
00:00:38.675 --> 00:00:43.113
"It's tornado season, and we have to prepare!"

11
00:00:43.114 --> 00:00:46.183
"Good idea," said Grandpa.

12
00:00:46.184 --> 00:00:50.756
"I'm captain of the team," said Katie.

13
00:00:50.757 --> 00:00:54.846
Grandpa raised his eyebrows. "The team?"

14
00:00:54.847 --> 00:00:59.044
"The Donovan Tornado Safety Team," said Katie.

15
00:00:59.045 --> 00:01:01.002
"We're having a meeting tonight.

16
00:01:01.003 --> 00:01:06.349
Hey! I better get ready."

17
00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:12.061
Joy was still hanging around the chicken coop when Dad came home from work.

18
00:01:12.062 --> 00:01:16.048
"Hi, guys. Nice chicken coop!" Dad said.

19
00:01:16.049 --> 00:01:19.036
"What's Katie so busy doing in the house?"

20
00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:21.234
"Hi, Dad," said Joy.

21
00:01:21.235 --> 00:01:25.041
"Oh, Katie is busy being team captain."

22
00:01:25.042 --> 00:01:27.971
She poked her toe around the pile of wood.

23
00:01:27.972 --> 00:01:32.169
"What are you going to do with this extra wood, Grandpa?"

24
00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:37.651
"I don't know," said Grandpa, scratching his chin.

25
00:01:37.652 --> 00:01:39.737
"Well," said Dad.

26
00:01:39.738 --> 00:01:43.102
"If I were eight years old, I know what I'd do.

27
00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.531
I'd build a tree house."

28
00:01:45.532 --> 00:01:49.412
"A tree house?" said Joy. "Hmm . . ."

29
00:01:49.413 --> 00:01:51.618
She looked at her father.

30
00:01:51.619 --> 00:01:55.616
"Do you think I could build a tree house?"

31
00:01:55.617 --> 00:02:00.648
"Well, sure," said Dad. "With a little help you could."

32
00:02:00.649 --> 00:02:05.259
"So we could be a team?" asked Joy.

33
00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:09.728
"You'll need some sturdy boards for the floor," said Grandpa.

34
00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:15.388
"I could get some tin for the roof at the recycling center," added Dad.

35
00:02:15.389 --> 00:02:18.214
Joy threw her arms around Dad.

36
00:02:18.215 --> 00:02:21.681
"This is going to be fun!" she said.

37
00:02:21.682 --> 00:02:24.941
"I'm going to draw a picture of our tree house.

38
00:02:24.942 --> 00:02:28.821
I can already imagine it!"

39
00:02:28.822 --> 00:02:32.463
After dinner Joy worked on her drawing in the living room.

40
00:02:32.464 --> 00:02:37.169
Grandpa sat across from her and studied his garden plan.

41
00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:41.611
"They say to watch the new oak leaves in the spring," he said.

42
00:02:41.612 --> 00:02:45.593
"When they get as big as a squirrel's ear, it's time to plant corn.

43
00:02:45.594 --> 00:02:49.183
Have you been watering your watermelon seeds, Joy?"

44
00:02:49.184 --> 00:02:53.765
"Of course, Grandpa," Joy answered, smiling.

45
00:02:53.766 --> 00:02:56.166
Then Katie marched into the room.

46
00:02:56.167 --> 00:02:58.522
"Let's start the meeting!"

47
00:02:58.523 --> 00:03:05.897
She wore a baseball cap with the word "CAPTAIN" written on the front.

48
00:03:05.898 --> 00:03:09.907
"Tornado season is here!" she announced.

49
00:03:09.908 --> 00:03:13.552
"The Donovan Tornado Safety Team must get ready!"

50
00:03:13.553 --> 00:03:16.630
She looked down at her notebook.

51
00:03:16.631 --> 00:03:19.095
"First, let's pick our shelter.

52
00:03:19.096 --> 00:03:22.625
It should be someplace below the ground."

53
00:03:22.626 --> 00:03:25.897
"I guess we should use the cellar," said Grandpa.

54
00:03:25.898 --> 00:03:28.342
"Just like we always have."

55
00:03:28.343 --> 00:03:31.996
"Good thinking," said Katie. "That was easy!

56
00:03:31.997 --> 00:03:36.974
Next, we need a radio and a flashlight."

57
00:03:36.975 --> 00:03:40.334
"I'll take care of those," offered Dad.

58
00:03:40.335 --> 00:03:43.947
"We also need a first aid kit," said Katie.

59
00:03:43.948 --> 00:03:46.935
"Mom, would you help with that?"

60
00:03:46.936 --> 00:03:49.855
"Aye, Captain."

61
00:03:49.856 --> 00:03:52.921
"Mom," groaned Katie.

62
00:03:52.922 --> 00:03:58.998
"Sorry, I couldn't resist," Mom said, laughing.

63
00:03:58.999 --> 00:04:03.965
"We'll also need some blankets and pillows," explained Katie.

64
00:04:03.966 --> 00:04:08.014
"I'll be in charge of them too," said Mom.

65
00:04:08.015 --> 00:04:12.727
"And Joy, we'll need bottled water and snacks."

66
00:04:12.728 --> 00:04:16.279
Joy jumped up. "Okay, I'll do it now.

67
00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:20.415
Come on, Dad. It's time to plan our tree house!"

68
00:04:20.416 --> 00:04:26.110
"Wait a minute," said Katie. "This meeting is not over."

69
00:04:26.111 --> 00:04:28.996
Joy sat back down, rolling her eyes.

70
00:04:28.997 --> 00:04:31.805
Katie was being bossy again.

71
00:04:31.806 --> 00:04:34.506
"A tree house?" thought Katie.

72
00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:38.505
She put her hand on her forehead and closed her eyes.

73
00:04:38.506 --> 00:04:40.987
"I'm getting a brilliant idea."

74
00:04:40.988 --> 00:04:43.849
Her eyes flew open.

75
00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.187
"Yes!" she shouted.

76
00:04:46.188 --> 00:04:50.349
"The Donovan Tornado Safety Team needs a tree house!

77
00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:52.924
It will be a weather lookout station!"

78
00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:56.232
She turned to her sister. "Build it!"

79
00:04:56.233 --> 00:04:58.708
Joy gave Katie a quick salute.

80
00:04:58.709 --> 00:05:02.324
"Aye, Captain!" she said, laughing.

81
00:05:02.325 --> 00:05:04.609
Katie might be bossy at times.

82
00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:09.681
But she could be funny too!

